=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 停止并清理</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">docker</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> compose</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> down</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -v</span></span></code></pre></div><hr>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>容器技术通过 Namespace 和 Cgroup 实现了轻量级的进程隔离和资源限制。Docker 提供了从镜像构建到容器运行的完整工具链。编写高效的 Dockerfile 需要掌握多阶段构建、层缓存优化和基础镜像选择等技巧。容器是云原生技术栈的基石——理解容器的原理和最佳实践，是学习 Kubernetes 和更上层编排技术的前提。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"容器基础","id":"容器基础"},{"level":2,"text":"什么是容器","id":"什么是容器"},{"level":2,"text":"容器的核心技术","id":"容器的核心技术"},{"level":3,"text":"Namespace（命名空间）","id":"namespace-命名空间"},{"level":3,"text":"Cgroup（控制组）","id":"cgroup-控制组"},{"level":2,"text":"Docker 核心概念","id":"docker-核心概念"},{"level":3,"text":"镜像、容器和仓库","id":"镜像-容器和仓库"},{"level":3,"text":"镜像分层","id":"镜像分层"},{"level":2,"text":"Dockerfile 最佳实践","id":"dockerfile-最佳实践"},{"level":3,"text":"多阶段构建","id":"多阶段构建"},{"level":3,"text":"层缓存优化","id":"层缓存优化"},{"level":3,"text":".dockerignore 示例","id":"dockerignore-示例"},{"level":2,"text":"镜像优化","id":"镜像优化"},{"level":3,"text":"基础镜像选择","id":"基础镜像选择"},{"level":3,"text":"镜像安全扫描","id":"镜像安全扫描"},{"level":3,"text":"镜像体积优化对比","id":"镜像体积优化对比"},{"level":2,"text":"容器运行时","id":"容器运行时"},{"level":3,"text":"容器运行时生态","id":"容器运行时生态"},{"level":2,"text":"容器网络","id":"容器网络"},{"level":3,"text":"网络模式","id":"网络模式"},{"level":2,"text":"容器存储","id":"容器存储"},{"level":3,"text":"数据持久化","id":"数据持久化"},{"level":2,"text":"Docker Compose","id":"docker-compose"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"告警策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/observability/alerting-strategy"},"next":{"title":"Kubernetes 核心","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cross-discipline/devops-sre/cloud-native-basics/kubernetes-essentials"}}